# Authoring rights and wrongs (pointer)

Before redesigning hardness, responding to platform EASY/MEDIUM/HARD
feedback, or inventing new pin/config tricks, open and follow:

`AUTHORING_RIGHTS_AND_WRONGS.md` (repo root)

When you learn a reusable right or wrong, **append it there** — do not
create `specs/<task>-authoring-lessons.md` or other per-task lesson files.
